Swarm Studio, deck looks (engine/opendesign/decks.json) and the deck slide styles (engine/deck.mjs)

decks.json is derived from html-ppt as shipped inside Open Design
Repository: https://github.com/nexu-io/open-design, path design-templates/html-ppt/
(commit bc06128813c99fa63f5af53ad2c903c27db057f2); upstream lewislulu/html-ppt-skill.
Copyright (c) 2026 lewis. License: MIT (see LICENSE.html-ppt in this folder).

Changes made for Swarm Studio (scripts/import-od-decks.mjs):
- From each theme in assets/themes/, only the shape tokens (radius, shadow, letter spacing), the colour
  tokens and the decoration rules are kept; colours in the rules that equal a theme token are pointed at
  that token, and page-background rules are moved onto the slide. Comments, @import and @font-face
  rules, the theme's font stacks and its animation and runtime files are dropped.
- 25 of the 36 themes are kept: those with a look of their own. The eleven that differ only in colour are
  left out, since a project's brand replaces the colours. Each kept look's one-line description is ours.
- The slide styles in engine/deck.mjs reuse html-ppt's class names and the sizes of its type, grid,
  card, pill and divider rules from assets/base.css, rescaled to a fixed 1920 x 1080 slide. The present
  mode script, the layouts and the PDF route are ours; html-ppt's runtime.js, animations, presenter
  window and templates are not used.
